text:
@Strictly Fashionables custom on the custom Gown for the TRADITIONAL WEDDING OF MY DREAMS!! Thank you Auntie Titi for making my first Traditional Wedding experience so easy and fun!! Loved working with you and getting the FULL experience! Highly recommend for custom gowns of ANY kind!! She does it all.. proms, formal gowns, parties! You name it!!! Tap in🤗😍
My best friend’s gown was also a custom from Titi …and she looks STUNNING!!! We are both so happy 🤗😍

#dmvtailor #traditionalwedding #asoebi #africantiktok #customgown
